# willow

--- Puppeteer_Dive | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_PUPPETEER_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Willow dives for <VALUE1> seconds, becoming untargetable but unable to take any action for the duration.
now  Willow dives for <VALUE1> seconds, becoming untargetable but unable to take any action for the duration.
